♪Save it now, binge it when it drops♪

1126
00:28:28,600 --> 00:28:30,160
A special show

1127
00:28:30,160 --> 00:28:32,160
for someone special.

1128
00:28:32,160 --> 00:28:35,760
WeTV has it all ready for you.

1129
00:28:40,060 --> 00:28:42,340
(Nervous, but holding it together)

1130
00:28:42,640 --> 00:28:43,600
(Before the livestream)
We're professionals.

1131
00:28:43,600 --> 00:28:44,960
Right after this segment,

1132
00:28:44,960 --> 00:28:47,240
we're watching the trailer
for The Road to Glory.

1133
00:28:47,240 --> 00:28:48,360
(Ke really wants to see it)
Let's watch.

1134
00:28:48,360 --> 00:28:50,480
Let's give our live reactions, okay?

1135
00:28:50,480 --> 00:28:51,880
Time for our hot takes.

1136
00:28:51,880 --> 00:28:53,080
I've never been this nervous

1137
00:28:53,080 --> 00:28:53,780
watching one of my own trailers.

1138
00:28:53,780 --> 00:28:55,120
(Lead actor getting nervous)

1139
00:28:55,120 --> 00:28:57,360
Because all of us are watching, right?

1140
00:28:58,080 --> 00:28:59,080
Here it comes.

1141
00:29:00,880 --> 00:29:03,400
I, Xiao Li, may be no good man...

1142
00:29:11,060 --> 00:29:14,340
(Fully immersed)

1143
00:29:14,340 --> 00:29:15,680
These shots now...

1144
00:29:18,960 --> 00:29:20,240
So handsome.

1145
00:29:20,240 --> 00:29:21,200
Chu Dejian.

1146
00:29:21,200 --> 00:29:21,900
(Director: Chu Dejian)

1147
00:29:28,000 --> 00:29:29,570
(Live dubbing: The Truth version)
Who in all of Yong City doesn't know

1148
00:29:30,320 --> 00:29:31,760
Xiao Li

1149
00:29:31,760 --> 00:29:34,080
is just the illegitimate son
of a courtesan

1150
00:29:34,080 --> 00:29:35,600
from the pleasure district?

1151
00:29:35,600 --> 00:29:36,920
Born in troubled times,

1152
00:29:36,920 --> 00:29:39,000
we can't choose what fate gives us,

1153
00:29:39,000 --> 00:29:40,280
but we don't have to surrender to it.

1154
00:29:41,520 --> 00:29:42,930
In this world,

1155
00:29:43,880 --> 00:29:46,120
has anyone ever truly protected me?

1156
00:29:48,280 --> 00:29:49,640
I've seen the behind-the-scenes clips
of this.

1157
00:29:51,760 --> 00:29:52,400
They're going opposite ways here.

1158
00:29:52,400 --> 00:29:53,520
If there wasn't...

1159
00:30:00,120 --> 00:30:01,400
Give him a line like this.

1160
00:30:01,400 --> 00:30:02,880
Will you marry me?

1161
00:30:05,240 --> 00:30:06,040
"To me, you..."

1162
00:30:06,040 --> 00:30:06,840
Wait, didn't you just...

1163
00:30:06,840 --> 00:30:08,180
I only ever used you...

1164
00:30:08,180 --> 00:30:09,120
"I never loved you."

1165
00:30:09,120 --> 00:30:10,400
Your lover stabbed you

1166
00:30:10,400 --> 00:30:11,560
straight through the heart, right?

1167
00:30:11,560 --> 00:30:12,640
(The Road to Glory)
That tear...

1168
00:30:12,640 --> 00:30:14,560
Your Highness,

1169
00:30:14,560 --> 00:30:15,640
why are you so flustered?

1170
00:30:18,320 --> 00:30:19,240
You...

1171
00:30:19,240 --> 00:30:20,040
Got reborn again?

1172
00:30:20,040 --> 00:30:20,680
Came back to life again?

1173
00:30:20,680 --> 00:30:21,280
Yes.

1174
00:30:22,240 --> 00:30:23,240
So handsome.

1175
00:30:23,260 --> 00:30:25,540
(Nonstop family-friendly laughs)

1176
00:30:25,720 --> 00:30:26,920
(Before the hula-hoop challenge)
Can I try it?

1177
00:30:27,320 --> 00:30:28,280
What do I do with this veil?

1178
00:30:28,280 --> 00:30:29,040
How are you...

1179
00:30:29,040 --> 00:30:30,760
(What now, Ke?)
Yeah, that's exactly what I'm asking.

1180
00:30:32,000 --> 00:30:33,200
No, I mean, she's spinning it...

1181
00:30:33,200 --> 00:30:34,840
(Someone back me up)
Like this, right?

1182
00:30:36,680 --> 00:30:38,240
Ready for winter.

1183
00:30:38,240 --> 00:30:39,300
Welcome to the Northeast.

1184
00:30:39,300 --> 00:30:39,980
(A warm welcome)

1185
00:30:40,160 --> 00:30:41,960
Straight off the heated brick bed.

1186
00:30:43,600 --> 00:30:45,360
I did this whole look.

1187
00:30:45,360 --> 00:30:48,440
I spent three hours on it.
Is this right?

1188
00:30:48,440 --> 00:30:49,660
(All that work, wasted)

1189
00:30:50,220 --> 00:30:51,620
(Back on track)

1190
00:30:52,440 --> 00:30:54,160
Careful!

1191
00:30:54,160 --> 00:30:55,760
You can't walk backward.

1192
00:30:55,760 --> 00:30:56,280
No walking backward.

1193
00:30:56,280 --> 00:30:57,200
(Reminder)
You have to face forward.

1194
00:30:59,640 --> 00:31:01,200
Is this right?

1195
00:31:01,260 --> 00:31:02,620
(Emergency adjustment)

1196
00:31:03,160 --> 00:31:04,680
If you remove it,
the hairstyle's gone.

1197
00:31:05,400 --> 00:31:06,560
(Gentle reminder)
We haven't even started yet.

1198
00:31:06,920 --> 00:31:08,000
(Ning's turn)
Ning, give it a try.

1199
00:31:08,000 --> 00:31:09,200
Let me see if I can walk with it.

1200
00:31:10,620 --> 00:31:12,900
(Charging up)

1201
00:31:13,040 --> 00:31:14,080
(New idea)
What if...

1202
00:31:14,080 --> 00:31:15,320
What if we do it like this?

1203
00:31:15,320 --> 00:31:16,560
You're putting it around your neck?

1204
00:31:16,560 --> 00:31:18,000
It'll choke you, Ning.

1205
00:31:18,920 --> 00:31:21,320
No, Ning. Don't.

1206
00:31:21,980 --> 00:31:23,700
(Okay, one serious try)

1207
00:31:27,000 --> 00:31:27,760
Oh, right!

1208
00:31:27,760 --> 00:31:28,360
You guys have long legs.

1209
00:31:28,360 --> 00:31:30,320
(Using the natural advantage)
Just keep it from dropping.

1210
00:31:30,320 --> 00:31:32,120
She said you have to keep it spinning.

1211
00:31:32,120 --> 00:31:33,460
(Follow the rules)
She just said that.

1212
00:31:34,400 --> 00:31:34,880
Come on.

1213
00:31:34,880 --> 00:31:35,380
(Passing it to the next person)

1214
00:31:35,960 --> 00:31:37,720
I can dance. I just can't hula-hoop.

1215
00:31:37,720 --> 00:31:39,780
(Different skill set)

1216
00:31:39,800 --> 00:31:41,240
(Live coaching)
Move your waist.

1217
00:31:41,240 --> 00:31:42,040
No.

1218
00:31:42,040 --> 00:31:43,040
Isn't it like this?

1219
00:31:43,040 --> 00:31:43,960
Yeah.

1220
00:31:43,960 --> 00:31:45,680
(Wiggles waist)
I can do that move too.

1221
00:31:45,680 --> 00:31:47,520
(Hula-hoop coaching activated)
Don't move your butt.

1222
00:31:47,520 --> 00:31:49,040
Then where do I move?

1223
00:31:49,040 --> 00:31:49,760
(Let me show you)
Your waist.

1224
00:31:49,760 --> 00:31:51,480
Waist and hips.

1225
00:31:52,100 --> 00:31:52,760
(Message received)

1226
00:31:52,760 --> 00:31:53,560
Like this?

1227
00:31:57,480 --> 00:31:59,000
Can I try?

1228
00:31:59,000 --> 00:31:59,960
If you can't do it,

1229
00:31:59,960 --> 00:32:02,480
(Jin's turn)
let someone else try.

1230
00:32:02,480 --> 00:32:04,240
What is that outfit?

1231
00:32:04,240 --> 00:32:05,860
(OOTD updated)
Where'd those slippers come from?

1232
00:32:06,840 --> 00:32:08,420
Come on, let me try.

1233
00:32:08,420 --> 00:32:09,300
(Giving it everything)

1234
00:32:11,320 --> 00:32:13,440
Jin Pretty is so cute.

1235
00:32:15,140 --> 00:32:18,100
(Whistling queen)

1236
00:32:18,480 --> 00:32:19,690
Can you teach me how to whistle?

1237
00:32:19,690 --> 00:32:20,460
(Back to school again)

1238
00:32:20,680 --> 00:32:21,680
You just practice on your own.

1239
00:32:21,680 --> 00:32:23,840
(Self-taught whistler)
Can you teach me, though?

1240
00:32:23,840 --> 00:32:24,320
How do you do it?

1241
00:32:24,320 --> 00:32:24,840
You can't whistle?

1242
00:32:24,840 --> 00:32:25,720
Nope.

1243
00:32:25,720 --> 00:32:26,600
You just practice.

1244
00:32:27,640 --> 00:32:28,410
How did you practice?

1245
00:32:29,400 --> 00:32:30,600
Press your tongue against...

1246
00:32:30,600 --> 00:32:31,160
Against what?

1247
00:32:31,160 --> 00:32:33,080
(Tongue-on-teeth method)
Your upper back molars.

1248
00:32:33,080 --> 00:32:34,640
I don't press mine there.

1249
00:32:34,640 --> 00:32:35,760
He's just whistling normally.

1250
00:32:35,760 --> 00:32:37,160
I don't touch my teeth when I whistle.

1251
00:32:38,320 --> 00:32:39,160
You don't have to.

1252
00:32:39,160 --> 00:32:40,000
Exactly.

1253
00:32:40,000 --> 00:32:41,280
Why would you?

1254
00:32:41,280 --> 00:32:42,160
You can do it without that.

1255
00:32:42,160 --> 00:32:43,000
No, it's actually really easy.

1256
00:32:43,000 --> 00:32:44,010
Just pucker your lips.

1257
00:32:44,960 --> 00:32:45,570
Relax.

1258
00:32:46,520 --> 00:32:47,280
Keep blowing air.

1259
00:32:47,280 --> 00:32:47,840
Adjust slowly.

1260
00:32:47,840 --> 00:32:48,580
You'll find the sweet spot.

1261
00:32:48,960 --> 00:32:50,640
Not a shh sound.

1262
00:32:50,640 --> 00:32:51,470
More like hoo.

1263
00:32:51,470 --> 00:32:52,340
(Pucker-and-blow method)

1264
00:32:52,900 --> 00:32:54,820
(Shooting a short video)

1265
00:32:56,460 --> 00:32:57,100
(Mischievous friends)

1266
00:32:59,080 --> 00:32:59,880
You!

1267
00:33:01,240 --> 00:33:02,400
They're fighting!

1268
00:33:02,400 --> 00:33:03,540
- Whoa, easy!
- Don't run!

1269
00:33:04,200 --> 00:33:05,480
Don't break his hand!

1270
00:33:05,480 --> 00:33:06,720
One take!

1271
00:33:07,720 --> 00:33:08,960
That was amazing!

1272
00:33:09,960 --> 00:33:11,800
Surprise!

1273
00:33:11,800 --> 00:33:12,360
Congrats!

1274
00:33:12,360 --> 00:33:13,600
You...

1275
00:33:13,600 --> 00:33:14,840
made it through!

1276
00:33:17,120 --> 00:33:20,320
Louder! I can't hear you!

1277
00:33:21,440 --> 00:33:22,600
Surprise!

1278
00:33:23,080 --> 00:33:25,440
Congrats, you made it through!

1279
00:33:35,520 --> 00:33:38,120
Mission accomplished!

1280
00:33:38,780 --> 00:33:40,940
(Side by side through time,
forever young)

1281
00:33:40,940 --> 00:34:01,300
=The Truth (Season 4)=
(Finale Calendar)

1282
00:34:18,020 --> 00:34:22,020
♪Come now, players all,
let the game of reason start♪

1283
00:34:22,020 --> 00:34:26,460
♪Unlock each hidden trial,
let courage spark the dark♪

1284
00:34:28,480 --> 00:34:32,640
♪Night falls slow, shadows grow,
the sleuth is lost inside the maze♪

1285
00:34:32,640 --> 00:34:36,860
♪Figures pass, lanterns sparse,
dark currents drift without a trace♪

1286
00:34:36,860 --> 00:34:40,630
♪Wind picks up, footsteps rush,
cold laughter swallowed by the dark♪

1287
00:34:40,630 --> 00:34:44,740
♪Truth concealed, the night
stands still, and nothing leaves a mark♪

1288
00:34:44,920 --> 00:34:49,040
♪An unsigned letter, coded words,
the solvers gather one by one♪

1289
00:34:49,040 --> 00:34:53,150
♪A broken game, illusion reigns,
who's hiding what they've done?♪

1290
00:34:53,150 --> 00:34:56,790
♪Hushed voices, nerves on edge,
wrapped in smoke and mirrors still♪

1291
00:34:56,790 --> 00:34:58,920
♪The next second, deeper riddles,
or the answer to the kill♪

1292
00:34:58,920 --> 00:35:02,870
♪Every piece of truth
has finally come to light♪

1293
00:35:03,110 --> 00:35:07,030
♪Unlock the mystery, turn the question,
let's begin tonight♪

1294
00:35:07,240 --> 00:35:11,390
♪Side by side, no holding back,
follow every clue to find the truth♪

1295
00:35:11,390 --> 00:35:14,950
♪The story blurs like flowers in fog,
let's begin tonight♪

1296
00:35:15,210 --> 00:35:19,860
♪Search for the vanished cipher,
trace the proof, and face the sleuth♪
